<https://n2t.net/ark:/27023/24fed99799ba78fe03de8903e0bf7aba> <https://colonialcollections.nl/schema#description> "1) M-4 bayonet\r\n\r\nAlthough first produced during World War II, the M-4 Bayonet was little used in the war for its intended purpose. Few Carbines were available with the bayonet adapter until the very end of WW II so the M-4 was primarily used as a general" .
